   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "texto",
     "titulo": "A visit by volunteers",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "先月、地域 の ボランティア が 被災地 の 村 を 訪れた。",
       "alumno": "Last month, local volunteers visited a village affected by the disaster.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "予定していた 家 を すべて 回る つもりだった が、雨 の あと 道路 が 通行止め に なり、最後 の 一軒 に は 行けず じまい だった。",
       "alumno": "They meant to visit all the houses they had planned, but after the rain the road was closed and in the end they could not reach the last house.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "その 家 の 人 は、玄関 に 置いた 荷物 を 片付けない まま、避難所 で 生活していた。",
       "alumno": "The family was living in the shelter without having tidied up the things they had left in the entrance.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "ボランティア は 住民 の 希望 を 聞いた うえで、必要な 物 を 届けた。",
       "alumno": "After listening to the residents' requests, the volunteers delivered the necessary items.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "活動 の あと、参加者 は「一度 では 終わらない。支援 を 続けたい」と 話した。",
       "alumno": "After the activity, the participants said: \"This doesn't end with one visit. We want to keep helping.\"",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
